  "description": "A beautifully presented two-bedroom apartment is available at Hanover Mills, ideally located in the heart of Grand Canal Dock, Dublin 2.\n\nOffering spacious, modern accommodation in one of Dublin's most sought-after city-centre locations, this apartment combines comfortable contemporary living with everything Grand Canal Dock has to offer right on your doorstep.\n\nThe apartment is fully furnished and features a bright, spacious open-plan living and dining area with excellent natural light.\n\nThe modern kitchen is fully equipped with quality appliances and finishes, while the accommodation includes two well-proportioned bedrooms, offering excellent space for city-centre living.\n\nThe apartment also benefits from private outdoor space, providing the perfect spot to relax while living in the heart of the city.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n* Spacious two-bedroom apartment\n* Fully furnished throughout\n* Bright open-plan living and dining area\n* Fully equipped contemporary kitchen\n* Two well-proportioned bedrooms\n* Private balcony or terrace\n* Modern bathroom facilities\n* Excellent storage\n* Energy-efficient heating system\n* Prime Dublin 2 location\n\nHanover Mills enjoys an exceptional location in Grand Canal Dock, one of Dublin's most vibrant and desirable neighbourhoods.\n\nResidents are within walking distance of the Bord Gáis Energy Theatre, Trinity College, Dublin city centre and the many waterfront cafés, restaurants and bars for which Grand Canal Dock is known.\n\nNearby Ringsend also offers an excellent selection of local amenities, parks and community facilities.\n\nThe development is exceptionally well connected, with convenient access to DART, Irish Rail, Luas and multiple Dublin Bus routes, making travel throughout Dublin straightforward.\n\nWith Dublin's major business districts, entertainment venues, restaurants and city-centre amenities all within easy reach, Hanover Mills offers an excellent opportunity to enjoy modern living in the heart of Dublin 2.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nPlease submit an enquiry through the advert with some brief information about the proposed tenancy and our lettings team will be in touch regarding viewing availability.",
